   ## Objective
   Find the real flag hidden among thousands of fake strings in an executable.
   
   ## Lab Details
   - **Type:** Binary Reverse Engineering / Static Analysis
   - **Tools:** Ghidra 12.1
   - **Target:** Windows 11 ARM VM
